  "kind": "interface",
  "area": "document-viewer",
  "description": "Inputs given to a renderer component instance. Renderers are plain standalone components that read these via `input.required(...)`. `source` is whatever the user passed in. Most renderers will want bytes — `loadSourceAsBytes()` in `document-viewer.helpers.ts` handles URL fetch / Blob unwrapping.",
